<ui-nav title="Flanker 任务" />
<view class="task-page ai-copilot-safe-space"><view class="task-content">
  <view class="task-heading"><text class="task-kicker">目标聚焦与干扰抑制</text><text class="task-title">Flanker 任务</text><text class="task-subtitle">忽略两侧符号，只判断中间箭头方向</text></view>
  <view class="task-card" wx:if="{{phase === 'intro' || phase === 'paused'}}"><text class="section-title">测试说明</text><text class="instruction">每次会显示一排符号。无论两侧箭头朝向如何，只选择中间箭头指向的方向。</text><view class="notice">任务包含相容、冲突和中性条件，左右方向数量平衡。</view><text wx:if="{{phase === 'paused'}}" class="paused-text">本项已中断，需要重新开始</text><button class="primary-button" bindtap="startTest">开始测试</button></view>
  <view class="task-card" wx:elif="{{phase === 'testing' || phase === 'feedback'}}"><view class="progress-row"><text>第 {{currentTrial}} / {{totalTrials}} 题</text><text>{{progressPercent}}%</text></view><view class="progress-track"><view class="progress-value" style="{{'width:' + progressPercent + '%;'}}"></view></view><view class="stimulus-area"><text class="flanker-stimulus">{{stimulusText}}</text><text class="instruction">请选择中间箭头方向</text></view><view class="answer-row"><button data-direction="left" bindtap="handleAnswer">向左</button><button data-direction="right" bindtap="handleAnswer">向右</button></view></view>
  <view class="task-card" wx:elif="{{phase === 'result'}}"><text class="section-title">结果摘要</text><view class="result-grid"><view class="result-stat"><text class="result-value">{{result.accuracy}}%</text><text class="result-label">正确率</text></view><view class="result-stat"><text class="result-value">{{result.conflict_effect_ms}} ms</text><text class="result-label">冲突效应</text></view></view><text class="sync-status">{{syncStatus}}</text><button wx:if="{{syncStatus === '待同步'}}" class="primary-button" bindtap="retrySync">重新同步</button><button wx:if="{{mode === 'battery'}}" class="secondary-button" bindtap="goNext">继续完整评估</button><button class="secondary-button" bindtap="startTest">重新测试</button></view>
  <text class="medical-tip">本测试仅记录客观注意控制指标，不替代专业医生诊断</text>
</view></view>
